Data::Tools::Process
==============

Data::Tools::Process provides process control functions: daemonizing, pid
files, forked process control and pools of forked processes with messaging.
Split from Data::Tools in 1.60, module names did not change.

INSTALLATION

To install this module type the following:

   perl Makefile.PL
   make
   make test
   make install

DEPENDENCIES

Data::Tools::Process requires Data::Tools, Net::Tools and Exception::Sink.

